(• The Entry Viewport: Visitors land on a distraction-free hero interface. There are no registration popups, no newsletter) Tj
T* (prompts, and no paywalls. The 3-parameter input card \(Breed, Age, Weight\) is front-and-center.) Tj
T* (• Typo-Tolerant Autocomplete: Real-time search across 200+ AKC breeds resolves typos gracefully.) Tj
T* (• Instant Reveal: Within milliseconds of input, the Epigenetic Human Age, median life span envelope, and Gompertz) Tj
T* (percentile growth curve render smoothly with zero delay.) Tj
ET
