45. 162. Td
(• Palpation & BCS Assessment: Interactive 1-9 Body Condition silhouette selector updates caloric guidance live.) Tj
T* (• Sensitivity Simulator: An animated pulse invites the user to drag the longevity slider, revealing live how weight management) Tj
T* (extends lifespan by up to 2.5 years \(Purina 14-Year Lifespan Study\).) Tj
T* (• Flagship Neural Voice Audition: Clicking "Audio Passport" synthesizes a 60-second broadcast-grade clinical overview) Tj
T* (tailored to the pet's breed and age, complete with waveform animation and glowing synchronized captions.) Tj
